#: woocommerce-scanpay.php:288
#: woocommerce-scanpay.php:319
msgid "You must accept the subscription terms to complete your purchase."
msgstr "Du skal acceptere abonnementsvilkårene for at gennemføre dit køb."

#: gateways/class-wc-gateway-scanpay-applepay.php:11
msgid "Apple Pay through Scanpay."
msgstr "Apple Pay via Scanpay."

#: gateways/class-wc-gateway-scanpay-card.php:13
